{
  "slug": "rill",
  "name": "Rill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for developing and querying projects in the Rill business intelligence platform",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `rill-analysis` (Overview of how to analyze data in a Rill project), `rill-canvas` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing canvas dashboard resources in Rill), `rill-connector` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing connector resources in Rill), `rill-development` (Overview of how to develop a Rill project), `rill-explore` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing explore dashboard resources in Rill), `rill-metrics-view` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing metrics view resources in Rill), `rill-model` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing model resources in Rill), `rill-rillyaml` (Detailed instructions and examples for developing the rill.yaml file), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rill-developer`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rill@claude-plugins-official` from `rilldata/agent-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
